{
  "bodyHash": "sPzRzxJWDe0=",
  "content": "<h1>✨ 元素附魔</h1>\n<p>一个为Fabric和Quilt设计的模组，添加了简单的元素附魔和一些诅咒效果，完善了原本孤立的火焰附加和燃烧附魔。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felemental-enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@2/assets/compact/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elementalenchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@2/assets/compact/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n\n<h2>🔧 需求/依赖</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fquiltmc.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/qsl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">QSL</a>，包含：\n<ul>\n<li>fabric-registry-sync-v0</li>\n<li>fabric-networking-api-v1</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MidnightLib</a>：\n<ul>\n<li>可选</li>\n<li>允许调整部分附魔/效果数值</li>\n<li>若修改设置后要与朋友联机，只需在服务端（或开启局域网世界的玩家）安装</li></ul></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>🧙‍♂️ 新增附魔</h2>\n<p>请查看<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgitlab.com%252fcrepes-o-mods%252felemental-enchantments%252f-%252fwikis%252fHome%252fAdded-Enchantments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此页面</a>获取最新描述与增强视觉效果。</p>\n\n<h4>暗影之触</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>月色真美？</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：夜晚（及雷暴天气）提升武器伤害，白天增加耐久损耗</li>\n<li>适用：剑 & 斧</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"#light-aspect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">光明之触</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1063/691/testa.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>大地之触</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>地震？在我脚下？！</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：攻击地面目标时将其击飞</li>\n<li>适用：剑</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252ffire_aspect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">火焰附加</a>、<a href=\"#frost-aspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">霜寒之触</a>、<a href=\"#wind-aspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">风之触</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1063/689/test.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"318\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>霜寒之触</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>是我的错觉，还是天气变冷了？</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：冻结攻击目标（雪粒特效）</li>\n<li>适用：剑</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252ffire_aspect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">火焰附加</a>、<a href=\"#wind-aspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">风之触</a>、<a href=\"#earth-aspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">大地之触</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1063/683/testa.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"337\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>光明之触</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>我爱白天</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：白天提升武器伤害，夜晚（及雷暴天气）增加耐久损耗</li>\n<li>适用：剑 & 斧</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"#dark-aspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">暗影之触</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1063/692/testa.gif\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>雷霆之触</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>箭矢咻咻咻</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：提升投射物速度</li>\n<li>适用：弓 & 弩</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fquick_charge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">快速装填</a>、<a href=\"#earth-curse\" rel=\"nofollow\">大地诅咒</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1063/693/testa.gif\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>风之触</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>谁想临阵脱逃？</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：将近距离攻击目标\"击退\"</li>\n<li>适用：剑</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fFire_Aspect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">火焰附加</a>、<a href=\"#frost-aspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">霜寒之触</a>、<a href=\"#earth-aspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">大地之触</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1063/709/wind-aspect.gif\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>黑暗诅咒</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>怪物们真可爱</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：夜晚（及雷暴天气）受到伤害增加，另有\"隐藏\"效果</li>\n<li>适用：护甲</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"#curse-of-light\" rel=\"nofollow\">光明诅咒</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h4>雷霆诅咒</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>听说被雷劈很常见</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：雷暴天气受击时召唤闪电</li>\n<li>适用：护甲</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"#curse-of-never-ending-fire\" rel=\"nofollow\">永恒之火诅咒</a>、<a href=\"#curse-of-never-ending-freezing\" rel=\"nofollow\">永恒冰霜诅咒</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1063/696/test.gif\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>永恒之火诅咒</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>过热时刻</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：燃烧状态永不解除</li>\n<li>适用：护甲</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"#curse-of-never-ending-freezing\" rel=\"nofollow\">永恒冰霜诅咒</a>、<a href=\"#curse-of-lightning\" rel=\"nofollow\">雷霆诅咒</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h4>永恒冰霜诅咒</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>愿你喜欢寒冬</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：冻结状态永不解除</li>\n<li>适用：护甲</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"#curse-of-never-ending-fire\" rel=\"nofollow\">永恒之火诅咒</a>、<a href=\"#curse-of-lightning\" rel=\"nofollow\">雷霆诅咒</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h4>光明诅咒</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>希望附近没有怪物...对吧？</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：白天受到伤害增加，另有\"隐藏\"效果</li>\n<li>适用：护甲</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"#curse-of-darkness\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑暗诅咒</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h4>大地诅咒</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>今天不玩远程，谢谢</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：投射物无初速，为武器提供近战伤害加成</li>\n<li>适用：弓 & 弩</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"#lightning-aspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">雷霆之触</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1063/710/curse-of-the-earth.gif\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<h4>狂风诅咒</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>所以，听说<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fknockback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">击退</a>是个垃圾附魔？</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>效果：造成强力击退效果，但抵消所有伤害</li>\n<li>适用：剑</li>\n<li>宝藏附魔：否</li>\n<li>冲突附魔：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fknockback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">击退</a>、<a href=\"#wind-aspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">风之触</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1063/701/test.gif\"></p>\n</div>",
